<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to our customers</strong><br />
<br />
We always strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but there is a limited amount of storage on board, and we need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin.
<p>While there has been no change to our cabin baggage policy, we have asked our airport staff and cabin crew to be more vigilant in identifying oversized items to reduce injuries and assist all customers to find adequate stowage on board.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If within limits permitted onboard, add</strong></em><br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that you were forced to check in your cabin bags when you were within your cabin baggage allowance — I’d like to assure you that your experience was not the service we strive to deliver.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If too many bags, add</strong></em><br />
<br />
There are times when our crew will need to place one bag in the hold if you board with multiple bags and the cabin is very full.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If staff were rude, add</strong></em><br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that our staff were not as courteous as expected, I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed this information on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If able to take onboard previously, add</strong></em><br />
<br />
I can see that you weren’t stopped with your multiple overweight bags at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} Airport and wanted to apologise if our staff didn’t seem to be applying our baggage rules consistently.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
I’ve passed on your feedback to Our Airport Manager in {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} Airport who will address this with the relevant staff members.<br />
<br />
Thank you for telling us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>